e,v=ev(47,'48–56','Gandharvas/Cāraṇas sing, Apsarases dance, Kinnaras play music and Nārada’s divine sages shower flowers. Śiva sends gods back to their offices; sages resume fear-free Veda/Vedāṅga practice and people renew agnihotra/sacrifices/donations/vows. Attendants including Śailādi, Gaṇapa and Skanda bow; Śiva dismantles/divides great chariot and returns decorated Kailāsa amid victory music. Tripurāri name spreads; narrator identifies mantra/thousand-name power and promises all wishes for reading/hearing account.',[('Śiva',D),('Śailādi (47 attendant)',F),('Gaṇapa (47 attendant)',F),('Ṣaṇmukha/Kārttikeya',D),('Gaṇeśa',D),('Tripura',A),('Cosmic Tripura-war chariot',C),('Kailāsa',L),('Gods',C),('Sages',C),('Nārada',S),('Gandharvas',C),('Cāraṇas',C),('Apsarases',C),('Kinnaras',C),('Tripura-account listeners',C)],story='gup2-story-tripura',cause='Liberation/death ends domination and ritual suppression.',outcome='Divine offices and social ritual restored; Śiva returns, closing warfare with lexical chariot/hymn atomic gaps separately pending.')
val('Śiva','source_epithet','Tripurāri spreads after this victory47.54.',e)
power('Tripura-account listeners',e,v,mechanism='All desired fruits for reading/hearing this account.',trigger='Reading/hearing account.')
